doc:Factsarticle_1 schema:abstract "A persistent challenge in machine learning is the computational inefficiency of neural architecture search, particularly in resource-constrained domains like predictive maintenance. The work introduces a learning-curve estimation framework trained on 62 predictive maintenance datasets, reducing neural architecture search computational costs by over 50% with only a 2% performance degradation."@en .
